# Unselected L2 POSIX non-strict path resolver for the documentation tools.
# Port of CPython3.14 posixpath.py391-508, strict=False/maxlinks=None only.
# Changes: owned counted heap vectors instead of Python lists/dictionary;
# one completion marker carries its seen key; every result is caller-owned.
# This is not libc realpath: missing/inaccessible components and link cycles
# still leave a spelling whose later '..' components must be processed.
# The Windows path resolver is a separate source part, not a fallback here.
